{"schemaVersion":1,"value":{"entries":[{"kind":"send-message","id":"tbs0","message":{"type":"text","content":"Hey Michael — I'm on it. I'll take a look at what's already connected and what bots you have, then we can stand up the rest of the staff."},"timestampMs":1788381632611,"requestId":"d06098b9-df32-4835-8713-87c480cc0d8e"},{"kind":"send-message","id":"tbs1","message":{"type":"text","content":"You’re the only bot so far, and nothing’s connected yet. For a CoS, the useful starting stack is [Gmail](grokbot://app/v1/plugin/add?id=45893410), [Google Calendar](grokbot://app/v1/plugin/add?id=45893411), [Google Drive](grokbot://app/v1/plugin/add?id=45893413), [Notion](grokbot://app/v1/plugin/add?id=404), and [Zoom](grokbot://app/v1/plugin/add?id=49047809). Tap those to connect in place.\nFigma and LinkedIn don’t have connectors, so I’ll use the browser for those. GitHub, Vercel, Stripe, and Canva can wait until we actually need them."},"timestampMs":1788381679505,"requestId":"d06098b9-df32-4835-8713-87c480cc0d8e"},{"kind":"send-message","id":"tbs2","message":{"type":"widget","widget":{"prompt":"I'd start by hiring a lean ops trio: inbox, calendar, and Notion. Want that, or a wider first staff?","options":[{"label":"Lean ops trio","value":"Start with inbox, calendar, and Notion","style":"primary"},{"label":"Add engineering too","value":"Ops plus engineering (GitHub and Vercel)"},{"label":"Full starter staff","value":"Full staff: ops, engineering, design, and revenue"}]}},"timestampMs":1788381679508,"requestId":"d06098b9-df32-4835-8713-87c480cc0d8e","respondedValue":"Full staff: ops, engineering, design, and revenue"},{"kind":"send-message","id":"tbs3","message":{"type":"text","content":"Standing up the four: Ops, Engineering, Design, and Revenue."},"timestampMs":1788381771963,"requestId":"f72fcd23-8a20-48d9-838e-715976d7b911"},{"kind":"send-message","id":"tbs4","message":{"type":"text","content":"They're live in the sidebar.\n\n- **Ops** — Gmail, calendar, Zoom, Drive, Notion\n- **Engineering** — GitHub and Vercel\n- **Design** — Canva, plus Figma in the browser\n- **Revenue** — Stripe\n\nI'll route work to them and pull you in when something needs a call. For this crew, also connect [GitHub](grokbot://app/v1/plugin/add?id=48677658), [Vercel](grokbot://app/v1/plugin/add?id=649), [Canva](grokbot://app/v1/plugin/add?id=32197178), and [Stripe](grokbot://app/v1/plugin/add?id=408). Then throw me the first real thing and I'll run it."},"timestampMs":1788381780404,"requestId":"f72fcd23-8a20-48d9-838e-715976d7b911"},{"kind":"message","id":"t0u","role":"user","content":"I think we’re all hooked up to everything.","isStreaming":false,"timestampMs":1788382913527,"clientNonce":"dbf8a9ba-d6aa-4b65-8b5f-68ec938c1db6","requestId":"a5bb377d-35f3-4d6e-a6a4-0a4fe28b6cd6"},{"kind":"send-message","id":"t0s0","message":{"type":"text","content":"Checking the connections now."},"timestampMs":1788382922729,"requestId":"a5bb377d-35f3-4d6e-a6a4-0a4fe28b6cd6"},{"kind":"send-message","id":"t0s1","message":{"type":"connector","connector":"Clerk","serverId":"4100713","variant":"connected"},"timestampMs":1788382944650,"requestId":"a5bb377d-35f3-4d6e-a6a4-0a4fe28b6cd6"},{"kind":"send-message","id":"t0s2","message":{"type":"connector","connector":"Canva","serverId":"4100556","variant":"connect"},"timestampMs":1788382944655,"requestId":"a5bb377d-35f3-4d6e-a6a4-0a4fe28b6cd6"},{"kind":"send-message","id":"t0s3","message":{"type":"connector","connector":"Stripe","serverId":"4099765","variant":"connect"},"timestampMs":1788382945437,"requestId":"a5bb377d-35f3-4d6e-a6a4-0a4fe28b6cd6"},{"kind":"send-message","id":"t0s4","message":{"type":"text","content":"Almost. Live: Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Vercel, X, Convex, and Clerk.\n\nStripe and Canva still need a sign-in — those cards are in the chat. GitHub is installed but auth didn’t start: it reported a badly formatted Authorization header, so signing in again would hit the same error. Notion and Zoom aren’t installed: [Notion](grokbot://app/v1/plugin/add?id=404) and [Zoom](grokbot://app/v1/plugin/add?id=49047809)."},"timestampMs":1788382950775,"requestId":"a5bb377d-35f3-4d6e-a6a4-0a4fe28b6cd6"},{"kind":"user-attachment","id":"t1ua0","file_path":"/home/box/sand-data/agents/b85a7a3c-6c23-4d10-9b4d-478a11f069a9/attachments/dfc511ed998c1342eebab5afb40aaf7a4179a49d146c7de191911324ab6fec37.png","timestampMs":1788390984183,"file_name":"IMG_2126.png","batchId":"f5913531-c068-4a5c-8b05-923224650864","clientNonce":"1acee181-84f1-42ee-b1b7-6b1a98a4cd93","width":1320,"height":2868,"byteSize":786747},{"kind":"message","id":"t1u","role":"user","content":"When i give full write permissions to my live account i see this but then verification fails","isStreaming":false,"timestampMs":1788390984184,"batchId":"f5913531-c068-4a5c-8b05-923224650864","clientNonce":"1acee181-84f1-42ee-b1b7-6b1a98a4cd93","requestId":"50b05ea1-4c3c-406d-9c66-e43de6b28070"},{"kind":"send-message","id":"t1s0","message":{"type":"text","content":"Stripe did authorize on their side — I'll check what the connector is doing after that."},"timestampMs":1788390997317,"requestId":"50b05ea1-4c3c-406d-9c66-e43de6b28070"},{"kind":"send-message","id":"t1s1","message":{"type":"text","content":"Stripe did authorize you. That checkmark is theirs. Verification is the app getting the token back, and that part never landed, so the connector is still disconnected.\nDo the retry on the same device as this chat, from the in-app card, and stay there until the card flips to connected. The screenshot was on your phone, which is a common way this handshake dies.\nBefore you tap it: in live mode, confirm MCP is actually on at [dashboard.stripe.com/settings/mcp](https://dashboard.stripe.com/settings/mcp) (sandbox and live are separate). If a leftover session is sitting in [user settings](https://dashboard.stripe.com/settings/user), revoke it first. Full write isn’t the problem. Stripe already said yes."},"timestampMs":1788391043930,"requestId":"50b05ea1-4c3c-406d-9c66-e43de6b28070"},{"kind":"send-message","id":"t1s2","message":{"type":"connector","connector":"Stripe","serverId":"4099765","variant":"connect"},"timestampMs":1788391048085,"requestId":"50b05ea1-4c3c-406d-9c66-e43de6b28070"}],"epochHint":null,"acceptedSequenceHint":null,"persistedAt":1788446758733}}